HonorBoot local controller

The experimental candidate sequence reproduces the arithmetic described by:
https://github.com/vcka/huawei-honor-unlock-bootloader
Original project: SkywalkerFR / vcka, Apache License 2.0.
This implementation is independently structured around durable state and recovery.
No claim is made that the original formula yields a valid Huawei unlock code.

Android platform-tools are not included. Obtain them from Google separately.
